# Vulnerabilities accepted after review, one CVE ID per line.
# Every entry needs a reason and an expiry date so it gets revisited, e.g.:
#
# CVE-2024-12345 exp:2026-12-31  # not reachable: we don't use the affected XML parser

# spring-webmvc 6.2.19: RCE via XsltView. Not reachable: the backend is a REST API with no
# XsltView or view rendering. Only fixed in Spring Framework 7 (Spring Boot 4).
CVE-2026-47884 exp:2027-01-31

# spring-webmvc 6.2.19: stream corruption in Server-Sent Events with view fragments. Not reachable:
# no SSE endpoints or view fragments. Only fixed in Spring Framework 7 (Spring Boot 4).
CVE-2026-47890 exp:2027-01-31
